            "line": 93,
            "text": "theorem partialT_pullback (d : ℝ) (vr vt : Plane) (F : Lift → ℝ) (q : Plane)\n    (hF : DifferentiableAt ℝ F (graph d vr vt q)) :\n    partialT (pullback d vr vt F) q = timeOp vt F (graph d vr vt q)"
